  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance - APPLIED COLD CHAIN BEST PRACTICES OUTREACH PROGRAM, through The Peoples Group, Ltd.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This $236,345 technical assistance outreach program provides a four-day forum for U.S. firms to present technologies and best practices for improving the operating efficiencies of Chinese refrigerated warehouses and refrigerated transportation systems. This forum offers an opportunity for U.S. firms to interact with Chinese government officials and industry representatives in the area of applied cold-chain best practice technology, product handling procedures and standards and takes place over four days in three cities: Guangzhou, Chengdu and Shanghai.</narrative>
  </description>
